00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.580
So many, people are having so much fun with my facts.

297
00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:02.080
What about Shannon, who was also from St. Louis?

298
00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:02.780
I know.

299
00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.360
Well, you listed them all.

