00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.840
You sort of talked for a while about St. Louis.

302
00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:13.900
But clearly, you went into this DVD commentary saying, guys, I hope I have some fun facts.

303
00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.460
So much so that they were like, you do have great facts.

304
00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:22.180
And it just cracked me up to hear you talking about your fun facts, and now you have your fast facts.

