00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:25.180
or a pair that were really popular at the time that P.

486
00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:26.000
Diddy was wearing.

487
00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:26.760
Oh.

488
00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:28.020
Okay.

489
00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:29.840
And they picked not P.

