00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:35.960
Diddy's glasses, but to also take them off for the sake of comedy.

494
00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:41.900
Well, at 32 seconds, Michael is going to try to parallel park.

495
00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:44.080
He is going to do this unsuccessfully.

496
00:22:44.220 --> 00:22:45.320
