00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:18.120
Well, I thought it was a really relatable moment because I know I've bailed mid-parallel park before.

505
00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:23.260
Especially if you're trying to parallel park somewhere where people are like eating outside.

506
00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:25.780
