1424
01:07:55.900 --> 01:07:57.800
They got one of Steve coming out of his trailer.

1425
01:07:57.980 --> 01:08:00.380
And it took us all a while to be like, oh, who's that guy?

1426
01:08:00.520 --> 01:08:00.980
Oh, my God.

1427
01:08:01.120 --> 01:08:01.420
Oh, wait, wait.

1428
01:08:01.520 --> 01:08:01.800
We don't.

1429
01:08:01.900 --> 01:08:02.720
No one knows that guy.

1430
01:08:02.960 --> 01:08:06.380
Did I mention in the commentary why we think this happened?

1431
01:08:06.740 --> 01:08:08.260
Finally, after five seasons?

1432
01:08:09.140 --> 01:08:09.440
No.

1433
01:08:10.740 --> 01:08:12.880
John had started dating Emily Blunt.

1434
01:08:12.980 --> 01:08:13.580
Oh, no.

1435
01:08:14.300 --> 01:08:14.700
Yeah.

1436
01:08:14.700 --> 01:08:19.120
Yeah, so that was sort of tabloidy interesting.

1437
01:08:19.480 --> 01:08:19.860
Mm-hmm.

1438
01:08:20.060 --> 01:08:25.120
Until now, none of us did anything of tabloid interest, basically.

1439
01:08:25.540 --> 01:08:25.860
No, no.

1440
01:08:26.040 --> 01:08:29.040
So I remember this because I was dating Lee at the time.

1441
01:08:29.200 --> 01:08:32.860
He and I were starting to get serious, and John started dating Emily.

1442
01:08:33.360 --> 01:08:35.140
And we became couple friends.

1443
01:08:35.340 --> 01:08:35.660
You did.

1444
01:08:35.740 --> 01:08:37.340
You guys would, like, go and do things.

1445
01:08:37.540 --> 01:08:37.920
We did.

1446
01:08:37.920 --> 01:08:42.840
And the news finally broke that the two of them were dating one another.

1447
01:08:42.840 --> 01:08:45.640
And I think that's why the paparazzi showed up.

1448
01:08:46.000 --> 01:08:46.920
Maybe so.

1449
01:08:47.140 --> 01:08:47.500
Mm-hmm.

1450
01:08:47.840 --> 01:08:50.940
Because it was just sort of, what, five years in out of nowhere.

1451
01:08:50.940 --> 01:08:52.560
Oh, this guy wants pictures.

1452
01:08:53.540 --> 01:08:54.580
Yes, exactly.

1453
01:08:54.940 --> 01:09:00.300
The one other time we had paparazzi show up was when we were shooting on location for Jim

1454
01:09:00.300 --> 01:09:01.080
and Pam's wedding.

1455
01:09:01.360 --> 01:09:02.020
Oh, yeah.

1456
01:09:02.120 --> 01:09:03.180
Well, that would have been a big.

1457
01:09:03.360 --> 01:09:04.960
That was like a big show event.

1458
01:09:05.080 --> 01:09:05.320
Yeah, yeah.

1459
01:09:05.460 --> 01:09:06.220
Within the show.

1460
01:09:06.220 --> 01:09:09.540
But for the most part, we didn't have any of that stuff.

1461
01:09:09.680 --> 01:09:10.840
We didn't, thankfully.

1462
01:09:11.080 --> 01:09:14.360
I'm glad that we were our, just our little, tucked away little studio.

1463
01:09:14.700 --> 01:09:15.440
I agree.

1464
01:09:16.080 --> 01:09:21.140
I do think at one point, the paparazzi got a shot of me leaving my trailer with, like,

1465
01:09:21.260 --> 01:09:23.300
my empty lunch plate.

1466
01:09:24.120 --> 01:09:25.920
And it is the moSt.

1467
01:09:26.100 --> 01:09:27.740
That made me, like, short laugh.

1468
01:09:28.580 --> 01:09:32.320
It is just, like, the most unflattering photo.

1469
01:09:32.760 --> 01:09:33.500
That is so perfect.

1470
01:09:33.500 --> 01:09:35.260
Of a person who has finished their lunch.

1471
01:09:35.800 --> 01:09:39.420
I, I, this was years later, you guys.

1472
01:09:39.600 --> 01:09:40.740
Like, the show had ended.

1473
01:09:41.080 --> 01:09:42.760
And I was vacationing.

1474
01:09:43.400 --> 01:09:48.260
And I was at a beach that I guess Maria Sharapova was at.

1475
01:09:49.420 --> 01:09:52.720
And the paparazzi clearly showed up for her.

1476
01:09:52.880 --> 01:09:55.140
But I was, like, side dish.

1477
01:09:55.500 --> 01:09:57.040
So they got the photos of her.

1478
01:09:57.100 --> 01:09:58.600
And then they snapped a few of me.

1479
01:09:58.860 --> 01:10:00.900
And it ended up in a tabloid magazine.

1480
01:10:01.240 --> 01:10:02.900
And I saw the picture of me.

1481
01:10:03.280 --> 01:10:06.760
And I was, like, how do I send them a thank you?

1482
01:10:07.420 --> 01:10:09.840
Was it a really good picture of you on vacation?

1483
01:10:09.840 --> 01:10:11.000
In my bathing suit.

1484
01:10:11.000 --> 01:10:13.620
And I was, like, I, I should thank someone.

1485
01:10:14.460 --> 01:10:17.540
I would say that we could put these photos in our stories.

1486
01:10:17.560 --> 01:10:21.920
But it's going to be, like, me hunching out of my empty food plate.

1487
01:10:22.080 --> 01:10:23.760
And you vacationing in Mexico.

1488
01:10:24.200 --> 01:10:26.040
I had just, like, been working out.

1489
01:10:26.140 --> 01:10:27.540
And I just want to sell someone.

1490
01:10:27.720 --> 01:10:28.100
Thank you.

1491
01:10:28.180 --> 01:10:29.440
Thanks for getting that for me.

1492
01:10:30.040 --> 01:10:33.360
Well, since we're on the subject, I will just give this one more anecdote.

1493
01:10:34.120 --> 01:10:39.020
I really, really did not get photographed by the paparazzi ever.

1494
01:10:39.220 --> 01:10:40.060
